#, fuzzy
msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:1
msgid "社区技术会议"
msgstr "Community Technical Meeting"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:3
msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend "
"定期召开社区技术会议，作为项目治理的核心决策机制。技术方向、大型方案评审、版本发布等重大事项均在技术会议上进行讨论和决策，由所有 "
"`Maintainer` 投票产生。会议对所有社区成员公开，任何人均可参加讨论，但决策和投票仅由 `Maintainer` 完成。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend holds regular community technical meetings as the core"
"decision-making mechanism for project governance. Major matters such as"
"technical direction, large-scale proposal reviews, and version releases"
"are discussed and decided in technical meetings, with votes cast by all"
"`Maintainers`. Meetings are open to all community members, and anyone"
"can participate in discussions, but decisions and voting are done only"
"by `Maintainers`."

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:5
msgid "会议内容"
msgstr "Meeting Content"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:7
msgid "技术方向讨论与决策"
msgstr "Technical direction discussion and decision-making"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:8
msgid "大型方案（RFC）评审与投票"
msgstr "Large-scale proposal (RFC) review and voting"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:9
msgid "版本发布计划与时间线"
msgstr "Version release planning and timeline"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:10
msgid "社区 Issue 和 PR 的优先级排序"
msgstr "Community Issue and PR priority ranking"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:11
msgid "贡献者提名与任免讨论"
msgstr "Contributor nomination and removal discussions"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:13
msgid "会议安排"
msgstr "Meeting Schedule"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:15
msgid "**例会频率**：双周"
msgstr "**Meeting Frequency**: Bi-weekly"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:16
msgid "**会议时间**：周五15:00"
msgstr "**Meeting Time**: Friday 15:00"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:17
msgid "**会议链接**：待公布"
msgstr "**Meeting Link**: To be announced"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:18
msgid "**会议纪要**：待公布"
msgstr "**Meeting Minutes**: To be announced"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:19
msgid "**议题提交**：待公布"
msgstr "**Agenda Submission**: To be announced"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:21
msgid "投票规则"
msgstr "Voting Rules"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:23
msgid "未参会的 `Maintainer` 需在会议后 3 个工作日内反馈投票意见，逾期未投票视为弃权"
msgstr "Maintainers who do not attend the meeting must provide their vote within 3 business days after the meeting; failure to vote within the deadline is considered abstention"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:24
msgid "投票以参与投票的 `Maintainer` 过半数同意即为通过（弃权不计入票数）"
msgstr "A vote is passed when more than half of the participating Maintainers agree (abstentions are not counted in the vote total)"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:25
msgid "投票结果记录在会议纪要中"
msgstr "Voting results are recorded in the meeting minutes"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:27
msgid "决策流程"
msgstr "Decision-Making Process"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:29
msgid "常规决策"
msgstr "Routine Decisions"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:31
msgid ""
"日常开发中的常规决策（如 `Bug` 修复、小功能改进）由相关模块的 `Maintainer` 在 `Issue` 或 `PR` "
"中审核决定，无需上会。"
msgstr ""
"Routine decisions in daily development (such as `Bug` fixes, minor"
"feature improvements) are reviewed and decided by the `Maintainer` of"
"the relevant module in the `Issue` or `PR`, without requiring a meeting."

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:33
msgid "重大决策"
msgstr "Major Decisions"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:35
msgid "以下事项视为重大决策，需在社区技术会议上由 `Maintainer` 集体讨论决定："
msgstr "The following matters are considered major decisions and require collective discussion by Maintainers at community technical meetings:"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:37
msgid "架构层面的重大变更"
msgstr "Major architectural changes"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:38
msgid "`API` 的破坏性变更"
msgstr "Breaking API changes"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:39
msgid "新增核心功能或移除已有功能"
msgstr "Adding core features or removing existing features"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:40
msgid "第三方依赖的重大升级"
msgstr "Major upgrades to third-party dependencies"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:41
msgid "版本发布计划"
msgstr "Version release planning"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:43
msgid "重大决策的流程："
msgstr "Major decision process:"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:45
msgid "提交 `RFC`（Request for Comments），描述变更内容、影响范围和实施方案"
msgstr "1. Submit an RFC (Request for Comments), describing the change content, impact scope, and implementation plan"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:46
msgid "在技术会议上进行讨论"
msgstr "2. Discuss at the technical meeting"

#: ../../zh/community/community_technical_meeting.md:47
msgid "`Maintainer` 共同决策"
msgstr "3. Maintainers make a joint decision"
